ich is one of the 21 cantons of the Orne department.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[2] This classification is based on the French administrative system, where communes are grouped into cantons, which are then grouped into arrondissements, and finally into departments.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"The canton of Écouves is a canton of France located in the Orne department, and it is composed of 23 communes, including Larré.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[3] The canton is named after the Écouves forest, which covers a significant part of the canton's territory.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"[1] \\\"Canton of Écouves\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE).\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"[2] \\\"Orne department\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE).\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[3] \\\"Canton of Écouves\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Wikipedia.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Retrieved 2023-02-20.\"}]}"
